			notes: ["Escape lighting runs from a source independent of normal lighting; battery packs cannot replace a generator supply.", "No single lamp failure may leave an area dark.", "Place luminaires within 2 m of corridor junctions, exit doors, changes of direction, stairs (each flight lit directly), level changes, outside final exits, fire alarm call points and firefighting equipment.", "Stair and ground-floor exit passageway lighting also needs an alternative supply."],
